OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FSaturday starts cold and frosty with
OL,7,Fsunshine for many, though cloudier in
OL,8,Fthe north and west. Sunday and Monday
OL,9,Fbring more unsettled conditions, with
OL,10,Frain and hill snow possible.
